---

<section class="hero-compact" aria-label="Hero">
  <h1 class="hero-heading">
    <span class="hero-after-dark">After Dark</span>
    <span class="hero-studio">Studio</span>
  </h1>
  <p class="hero-subheading">Your home should fit you, not the other way around.</p>
  <p>
    A 2‑session, hands‑on layout and systems service for renters in Hong Kong
    who want a calm, functional home using <em>mostly what they already have</em> –
    not a buy‑everything‑new makeover.
  </p>
  <p class="hero-tag">Because even a one‑year rental deserves a real home.</p>

  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a class="btn-primary" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScMhkQxJpi7S7oCcPvw5a082q0Zt38LkCtar3LjJriCU107GA/viewform" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Book a free 15‑minute Home Fit Call</a>
    <p class="hero-secondary">Or WhatsApp me 3 photos: <a href="https://wa.me/85290543117">+852 9054 3117</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @font-face {
    font-family: "Calistro MT";
    src: url("/fonts/calistro-mt.ttf") format("truetype");
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: "Ebrima";
    src: url("/fonts/ebrima.ttf") format("truetype");
  }

  .hero-compact {
    --section-bg: var(--bg);
    --section-heading: var(--heading);
    --section-text: var(--text);
    --section-accent: var(--accent-tan);
    --section-accent-text: var(--bg);
    --section-accent-hover: var(--accent-teal);
    --section-accent-link: var(--accent-teal);
    background: var(--section-bg, var(--bg));
    color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
    padding: 1rem 0 3rem;
  }

  .hero-heading {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: #1e293b;
  }

  .hero-after-dark {
    font-family: "Calistro MT", serif;
    display: inline;
  }

  .hero-studio {
    font-family: "Ebrima", sans-serif;
    display: inline;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .hero-subheading {
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.2rem);
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
    font-weight: 400;
    max-width: 56ch;
  }

  .hero-compact p {
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
    max-width: 56ch;
  }

  .hero-tag {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
  }

  .hero-actions {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.6rem;
    background: var(--section-accent, var(--accent-tan));
    color: var(--section-accent-text, var(--bg));
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    border: 2px solid var(--section-accent-hover, var(--accent-teal));
    padding: 0.68rem 1.48rem;
  }

  .hero-secondary {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .hero-secondary a { color: var(--section-accent-link, var(--accent-teal)); }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .hero-compact {
      padding-bottom: 2.25rem;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>
